{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FAFCFE\\,#EFF5FD)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#171A1E\\,#1B1F26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{site.y}+({site.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#1A73E8|#8AB4F8",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "site",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "170pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasSite},__none__),__none__),${@i18n.fnT},if::(eq::(${hasSite},1),${siteLabel},${@i18n.noSite}))]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "_note": "取数时刻锚点(标准 §4.4)。这一格原来渲的是窗口标签「近 28 天」——**卡上一个时间戳都没有**,而 traffic.df 早就算好了 `at` 并过了 resultFilter,只是没人渲。窗口标签挪到折线下面的 #win(它标的是折线,不是取数时刻)。\n⚠️ 判据写成 `eq::(ok,1)` 而不是 sites.rcn 那样的 `eq::(ok,0)`:未选站点时 `ok` 压根没被 set(它在 `if hasSite` 分支里),而 VParser 的 eq 是数字化比较、空串跟 0 会判等 —— 拿 `eq::(ok,0)` 当判据会让「还没选站点」那一态渲出「暂时取不到」。",
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "310.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${hasSite},1),if::(eq::(${ok},1),${at},${@i18n.err}),)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),1,0)]"
        },
        "_note": "新站点还没数据(nd=1):一句话替掉大数字、涨跌与折线 —— 不渲「0」(那是假的零)。",
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "nd1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "36pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.noData}",
            "fontSize": "15pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          },
          {
            "id": "nd2",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "58pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "2",
            "lineSpacing": "2pt",
            "text": "${@i18n.noDataS}",
            "fontSize": "10pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${clicksS},--),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "32pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),1,0)]",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${clicksS},--)]",
                "fontSize": "34pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.nbsp}",
                "fontSize": "20pt"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.clicks}",
                "fontSize": "11pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${clicksS},--),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "42pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "hide": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),1,0)]",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "--",
                "fontSize": "34pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.nbsp}",
                "fontSize": "20pt"
              },
              {
                "text": "${@i18n.clicks}",
                "fontSize": "11pt",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tri",
        "type": "path",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "73.3pt",
        "w": "8pt",
        "h": "5.28pt",
        "d": "$[if::(eq::(${up},1),M128 64 L240 192 L16 192 Z,M128 192 L16 64 L240 64 Z)]",
        "viewBox": "0 0 256 256",
        "fillColor": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(${up},1),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),if::(eq::(${up},0),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),#9AA0A6))))]",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),1,if::(gt::(length::(${up}),0),0,1))]"
      },
      {
        "id": "flatBar",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "75.25pt",
        "w": "7pt",
        "h": "1.5pt",
        "bgColor": "#9AA0A6|#8E939B",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,1)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,if::(gt::(length::(${up}),0),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "chg",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "26.0pt",
            "y": "72pt",
            "w": "148pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${chgTxt} ${@i18n.vs}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(${up},1),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),if::(eq::(${up},0),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),#9AA0A6))))]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[eq::(${flat},1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "chgFlat",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "26.0pt",
            "y": "72pt",
            "w": "148pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.flatMsg}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6,if::(eq::(${up},1),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),if::(eq::(${up},0),if::(eq::(${up},1),#1FC77D,#FF5C4D),#9AA0A6))))]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "sparkAxis",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[0,47.0,150.0,47.0]",
            "lineWidth": "1pt",
            "strokeColor": "#1A0E1116|#1AF3F4F6",
            "x": "174pt",
            "y": "26pt",
            "w": "150.0pt",
            "h": "48.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "spark",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[${pts}]",
            "lineWidth": "1.8pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "lineJoin": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#1A73E8|#8AB4F8",
            "coverageColor": "linear(#4A1A73E8\\,#001A73E8)@90|linear(#4A8AB4F8\\,#008AB4F8)@90",
            "x": "174pt",
            "y": "26pt",
            "w": "150.0pt",
            "h": "48.0pt",
            "_note": "折线本体 + coverageColor 渐变面积。coverageColor 与 bgColor 走同一个 paint 构建器,所以面积可以是渐变、不必是平涂;它也能脱离可见描边单独存在(水印卡就是这么用的)。"
          },
          {
            "id": "sparkHalo",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[143.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)],144.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "12.0pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#2E1A73E8|#2E8AB4F8",
            "x": "174pt",
            "y": "26pt",
            "w": "150.0pt",
            "h": "48.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "sparkRing",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[143.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)],144.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "7.9pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A",
            "x": "174pt",
            "y": "26pt",
            "w": "150.0pt",
            "h": "48.0pt"
          },
          {
            "id": "sparkDot",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[143.99,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)],144.0,$[findNotEmpty::(${lastY},-99)]]",
            "lineWidth": "5.3pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#1A73E8|#8AB4F8",
            "x": "174pt",
            "y": "26pt",
            "w": "150.0pt",
            "h": "48.0pt"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "折线的窗口标签。**必须写出「截至 3 天前」**:traffic.df 的窗口是 `dFrom=now-31d ~ dTo=now-3d`(Search Console 数据本身滞后 2–3 天,窗口没错),但卡上只写「近 28 天」会被读成「到今天为止」—— 用户按这个数字判断「昨天发的那篇有没有量」就必然判错。窗口是事实,不说出来就是数据在骗人。",
        "id": "win",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "174pt",
        "y": "77pt",
        "w": "150.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.win}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasSite},0),1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok},0),1),1,0),0),1),0,2)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasSite},__none__),__none__),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "stN",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "73pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.unbound}",
            "fontSize": "10.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${hasSite},0),1),if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${ok},0),1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "stF",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "73pt",
            "w": "160pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.failed}",
            "fontSize": "10.5pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tl0",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "92pt",
        "w": "99.33333333333333pt",
        "h": "52pt",
        "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "12pt",
          "leftB": "12pt",
          "rightT": "12pt",
          "rightB": "12pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tk0",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "24.0pt",
        "y": "103pt",
        "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.imps}",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${impsS},--)),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "tv0",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "24.0pt",
            "y": "118pt",
            "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${impsS},--))]",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${impsS},--)),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "tv0E",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "24.0pt",
            "y": "124pt",
            "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tl1",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "119.33333333333333pt",
        "y": "92pt",
        "w": "99.33333333333333pt",
        "h": "52pt",
        "bgColor": "#E7E9EE|#20232A",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "12pt",
          "leftB": "12pt",
          "rightT": "12pt",
          "rightB": "12pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tk1",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "129.33333333333331pt",
        "y": "103pt",
        "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.ctr}",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${ctrTxt},--)),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "tv1",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "129.33333333333331pt",
            "y": "118pt",
            "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${ctrTxt},--))]",
            "fontSize": "20pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${nd},0),1),--,findNotEmpty::(${ctrTxt},--)),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "tv1E",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "129.33333333333331pt",
            "y": "124pt",
            "w": "79.33333333333333pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "--",
